    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13142" root="دمن" body-key="d">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تدمّن</span></b>  app. signifies <i>It</i> (water, or a place,)
<i>had dung of sheep</i> or <i>goats,</i> or <i>of camels, fallen
into it,</i> or <i>upon it:</i> see its part. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَدَمَّنٌ</span>,
below.]

